<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/impactStatement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Explains why a VEX product is not affected by a vulnerability. It is an\nalternative in VexNotAffectedVulnAssessmentRelationship to the machine-readable\njustification label."@en .
